WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.793 --> 00:00:25.285
"I love the beach!" Dipper said.

2
00:00:25.286 --> 00:00:28.036
"Me too," Eddy said.

3
00:00:28.037 --> 00:00:35.968
"The sun feels warm."

4
00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:39.236
"This is boring," Zippy said.

5
00:00:39.237 --> 00:00:44.773
"I can't go fast on sand!"

6
00:00:44.774 --> 00:00:51.531
The cars were on a field trip.

7
00:00:51.532 --> 00:01:01.515
They were at Tire Town Beach.

8
00:01:01.516 --> 00:01:06.521
"The water looks fun," said Dipper.

9
00:01:06.522 --> 00:01:09.417
Ms. Fender frowned.

10
00:01:09.418 --> 00:01:10.927
"Don’t forget.

11
00:01:10.928 --> 00:01:19.402
Cars cannot go in the water."

12
00:01:19.403 --> 00:01:22.157
Jeb dug sand.

13
00:01:22.158 --> 00:01:29.273
He loaded it in Eddy's dumper.

14
00:01:29.274 --> 00:01:32.358
A boat floated on the sea.

15
00:01:32.359 --> 00:01:34.902
"Wow," Dipper said.

16
00:01:34.903 --> 00:01:37.322
"I wish we could float."

17
00:01:37.323 --> 00:01:39.403
Poppy nodded.

18
00:01:39.404 --> 00:01:42.733
"The water looks fun," she said.

19
00:01:42.734 --> 00:01:46.455
"It sure does!" Gasser said.

20
00:01:46.456 --> 00:01:52.064
Gasser looked around.

21
00:01:52.065 --> 00:01:56.680
"I don't see Ms. Fender," he said.

22
00:01:56.681 --> 00:01:59.115
Brumm, brumm!

23
00:01:59.116 --> 00:02:03.447
Gasser went fast.

24
00:02:03.448 --> 00:02:07.992
Gasser zoomed through the water.

25
00:02:07.993 --> 00:02:12.927
It splashed everyone!
